        "text": "#include <plc.hpp>\n\n// GUI serialization candidate only. Do not RUN or trigger an exchange.\n// SL1 master settings are retained from the exact saved CE40T template.\n// Execute is memory M12; outputs Q8..Q11 show Done/Busy/Aborted/Error.\nplc::WriteVar remote{0, plc::Link::Serial1, 1, 100,\n    plc::Object::Coils, 73, 17, 240};\n\nvoid scan() {\n    bool done = remote.update(plc::read_m(12), false);\n    plc::output(8, done);\n    plc::output(9, remote.busy());\n    plc::output(10, remote.aborted());\n    plc::output(11, remote.error());\n}\n",
